## 7. Feature-Level Target State

Integrations should treat every credential as a governed delegated capability: vault-backed, environment-scoped, user/provider-account aware, refreshable, revocable, auditable, and redacted. Tool execution should select credentials through policy and consent records, support pending authorization/approval, and emit linked audit/trace evidence. SDKs should include authorization challenge helpers. Health checks should verify real provider/OAuth/MCP state and label manual checks. Tests should cover credential scope, secret redaction, vault access audit, OAuth lifecycle, delegated tool calls, and adapter redaction.
